    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nhama ku'nguno ya malwile ga ndi'li'",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' Gu'ku' Mulungu wav'awi'laga Mose na Aloni ati', ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“U'lu' muntu' ninga yu'mo av'e na wu'vimbe ku' ndi'li' ya mu muv'i'li' gwakwe, ninga wu'landi, ninga ibado, na ki'ntu' i'cho ki'li'wikola ku'v'a ki'ti' wu'lwile wa ndi'li' mu muv'i'li' gwakwe, haho alaletwe ku'mwa Aloni ninga ku' yu'mo mugati' na v'ana v'akwe v'a ki'gosya v'ahozya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe muhozya alahikomye ha wu'vimbe wenu'wo wa ha igu'lya na ndi'li', na u'lu' wu'yenze wa henanho wagalu'kile na ku'v'a wape, na u'lu' wu'vimbe wingi'lile mugati' na ndi'li', hohene yi'ligelisye ku'v'a yi'li' wu'lwile wa ndi'li'. Muhozya alav'e u'lu' wamali'la ku'mwikomya, haho alamutangazye ku'v'a ali' na zoma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali'vi wu'vimbe wenu'wo ninga i'vi wape, u'lu' wu'kingi'la mugati' na ndi'li', na wu'yenze wu'kagalu'kile ku'v'a wape, haho muhozya alamukome muntu' mwenu'yo av'e ha winene ku' itungo lya nsiku' mupungati'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yi'lav'e lu'siku' lwa mupungati', muhozya alamwikomye hangi' muntu' mwenu'yo, nawe u'lu' wawona ku'v'a wu'vimbe wenu'wo wu'kalandalile ku' ndi'li' yakwe, hohene muhozya alamukome hangi' av'e inene ku' itungo lya nsiku' mupungati' zingi'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "U'lu' lwafika lu'siku' lwa mupungati', muhozya alamwikomye hangi'. U'lu' yi'v'e wu'vimbe wenu'wo wadohaga na wu'kalandalile ha igu'lya na ndi'li', haho muhozya alamutangazye ku'v'a wav'aga musoso, na wu'li' wu'vimbe du'. Yi'lamudime muntu' mwenu'yo avikanze vizwalo vyakwe, nawe alav'e wasosoka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali'vi u'lu' wu'vimbe wenu'wo wakalandala ku'fuma muntu' mwenu'yo aho ndi' wilagi'la ku' muhozya ku'nguno ya ku'sosohiwa kwakwe, hohene yi'lamudime ku'ya hangi' ku' muhozya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho muhozya alamwikomye hangi'. U'lu' wu'vimbe wu'landalile ku' ndi'li' hohene muhozya alamutangazye ku'v'a muntu' mwenu'yo ali' na zoma. Wenu'wo wu'li' wu'lwile wa ndi'li'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“U'lu' muntu' wu'mudime wu'lwile wa ndi'li', alafilwe ku' muhozya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe muhozya alamwikomye na u'lu' ali' na wu'vimbe wape ha igu'lya na ndi'li' na wu'yenze wagalu'kile ku'v'a wape, na wu'vimbe wenu'wo wagalu'kile na ku'v'a ki'londa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wenu'wo sanga wu'li' wu'lwile wa ndi'li' u'wo wu'kakowola ku'pi'la. Haho muhozya alamutangazye ku'v'a ali' na zoma. Yi'lav'e ku'du'hu' nguno ya ku'mukoma ku'nguno ya ku'mwikomya, ku'nguno yigelisyaga ali' na zoma.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ali'vi wenu'wo wu'lwile wa ndi'li' u'lu' wu'lav'e wigelisyaga ku' ndi'li' ya mulwile, na walandalaga ku' muv'i'li' gose, ku'fuma ku' mutwe mpaka ku' magu'lu', ki'ti' i'vyo muhozya alav'e wamuwonaga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "muhozya alamwikomye. U'lu' nhana wu'lwile wa ndi'li' wakalandala mu muv'i'li' gose, hohene alamutangazye ku'v'a muntu' mwenu'yo ali' musoso. Ku'nguno muv'i'li' gwakwe gwakagalu'ka na ku'v'a gwape yi'li'wigela wu'lwile wakav'i'ta. Muntu' mwenu'yo ali' musoso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali'vi u'lu' yigele mu muv'i'li' gwa muntu' mwenu'yo ku'li' na ki'londa, hohene muntu' mwenu'yo alav'e na zoma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muhozya alakikomye cheni'cho ki'londa na ku'mutangazya muntu' mwenu'yo ku'v'a ali' na zoma. Ki'londa cheni'cho ki'li' zoma, ku'nguno wenu'wo wu'li' wu'lwile wa ndi'li'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sumbwa ki'londa cheni'cho u'lu' ki'galu'ke hangi' na ku'v'a chape, yi'lamudime muntu' mwenu'yo ku'su'v'a ku' muhozya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe muhozya alamwikomye na u'lu' waki'wona ku'v'a nhana chagalu'kaga na ku'v'a chape, hohene alamutangazye muntu' mwenu'yo ku'v'a zoma yamalaga na wav'aga musoso.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Hangi' u'lu' muntu' av'e na ipute ku' ndi'li' yakwe, nalyo li'pi'le, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ali'vi aho ndi' hali' na ipute u'lu' hav'e na wu'vimbe wape, ninga wape wa wazaa, yi'lamudime akiyoleche ku' muhozya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe muhozya alahikomye henanho ha wu'vimbe, na u'lu' wingi'lile mugati' na ndi'li', na wu'yenze wagalu'kile ku'v'a wape, haho muhozya alamutangazye ku'v'a ali' na zoma. Wenu'wo wu'li' wu'lwile wa ndi'li' u'wo wakafumi'i'la ku' ipute. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali'vi muhozya u'lu' wamwikomya muntu' mwenu'yo na ku'wona wu'yenze wa ha lwandi' lwenu'lo wu'kav'ile wape na wu'vimbe wu'kingi'la mugati' na ndi'li', ali'vi hali'pi'li'zya, hohene muhozya alamukome muntu' mwenu'yo av'e ha winene ku' itungo lya nsiku' mupungati'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' u'lu' wu'vimbe wize wu'v'e wakalandala ha ndi'li', haho muhozya alamutangazye ku'v'a ali' na zoma. Wenu'wo wu'li' wu'lwile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali'vi u'lu' wu'vimbe wenu'wo wu'li' vyene vivyo, na wu'kalandala, yi'li' iv'amba lya ipute du'. Muhozya alamutangazye muntu' mwenu'yo ku'v'a ali' musoso.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
