          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“U'lu' muntu' av'e na lwandi' u'lo ndi' wapya ha ndi'li' yakwe na lu'galu'ke lu'v'e ki'londa cha wape ninga wape wa wazaa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "haho muhozya alahikomye. U'lu' awone wu'yenze wa henanho wagalu'kaga na ku'v'a wape na wu'vimbe wingi'lile mugati', wenu'wo sanga wu'li' wu'lwile wa ndi'li' u'wo wakamudima ha wu'pye wa moto. Haho muhozya alamutangazye muntu' mwenu'yo ku'v'a ali' na zoma. Wu'li' wu'lwile wa ndi'li'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali'vi muhozya u'lu' ahikomye na ku'wona wu'yenze wa henanho wu'kav'ile wape na wu'vimbe wu'kingi'la mugati' na hapi'li'zizye, haho muhozya alamukome muntu' mwenu'yo av'e ha winene ku' itungo lya nsiku' mupungati'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lu'siku' lwa mupungati' muhozya alamwikomye hangi', na u'lu' awone wu'vimbe wu'landalile ku' ndi'li', haho muhozya alamutangazye muntu' mwenu'yo ku'v'a ali' na zoma. Wenu'wo wu'li' wu'lwile wa ndi'li'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali'vi u'lu' lwandi' lwenu'lo lu'li' vyene vivyo na lu'kalandala, sumbwa hali'pi'li'zya, wenu'wo wu'li' wu'vimbe ku'nguno ya ku'pya moto du'. Haho muhozya alamutangazye muntu' mwenu'yo ku'v'a ali' musoso. Lyeni'lo li'li' iv'amba ku'nguno ya ku'pya moto.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Hangi' muntu' u'yo alav'e na wu'vimbe ku' mutwe ninga ku' ki'lezu, av'e mugosya ninga muki'ma, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "haho muhozya alawikomye wu'vimbe wenu'wo. Muhozya u'lu' awone wu'vimbe wingi'lile mugati' na ndi'li', na nyele zyakav'a zya njano na zyakanieniengala, haho muhozya alamutangazye muntu' mwenu'yo ku'v'a ali' na zoma. Genago gali' mapatu' na wu'li' wu'lwile wa ndi'li' wa ku' mutwe ninga ku' ndezu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali'vi u'lu' muhozya ahikomye ha mapatu' genago nago gigele gakingi'lile mugati' na ndi'li' sumbwa ku'du'hu' nyele nnilawu'zu, haho muhozya alamukome muntu' mwenu'yo ku' itungo lya nsiku' mupungati'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lu'siku' lwa mupungati' muhozya alagikomye hangi' mapatu' genago. U'lu' gakalandalile na gali' wu'du'hu' nyele zya langi ya njano na gakingi'lile mugati' na ndi'li', ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yi'lamudime muntu' mwenu'yo amogwe nyele zyakwe, sumbwa ha mapatu' hakasye hamogwe. Haho muhozya alamukome ha winene muntu' mwenu'yo ku' itungo lya nsiku' mupungati' zingi'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lu'siku' lwa mupungati' muhozya alagikomye hangi' mapatu' genago. U'lu' wawona ku'v'a gakalandalile na gakingi'lile mugati' na ndi'li', haho alamutangazye muntu' mwenu'yo ku'v'a ali' musoso. Muntu' mwenu'yo yi'lamudime ku'vikanza vizwalo vyakwe, nawe alav'e wasosoka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali'vi u'lu' mapatu' gize galandale ku'fuma ha itungo lya ku'tangaziwa wu'soso wakwe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "muhozya alamwikomye muntu' mwenu'yo. U'lu' gav'e mapatu' nhana galandalile, ku'lav'e ku'du'hu' nguno ya muhozya ku'mwikomya nyele zya njano, ku'nguno muntu' mwenu'yo ali' na zoma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ninga vyeni'vyo, u'lu' wamwikomya na ku'wona akagalu'kile, na nyele nnilawu'zu zimelile henanho, mapatu' genago sanga gapi'laga na muntu' mwenu'yo akav'ile na zoma. Haho muhozya alamutangazye ku'v'a ali' musoso.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
