          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ali'vi u'lu' muhozya awikomye na ku'wona ku'v'a wule wenu'wo wu'kalandala ku' mwenda ninga ki'ntu' cheni'cho, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "haho muhozya alasemuzye ki'kanzwe, nawe alaki'kome ku' itungo lya nsiku' mupungati' hangi'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.54"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "55",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:55"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' muhozya alagwikomye mwenda gwenu'go ninga ki'ntu' u'lu' chakanzwa. U'lu' yigele wu'kagalu'kile langi ninga i'vyo wu'kalandala, sanga ki'li' na zoma. Mwenda ninga ki'ntu' cheni'cho ki'latimwe, ninga ki'v'e na wu'v'ipiwe wa wule mugati' ninga ha ibala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.55",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.55"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "56",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:56"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "56",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali'vi u'lu' muhozya awone ku'v'a wule walamulaga ku'zimangu'ka ku'fuma aho ndi' chakanzwa, hohene alahazemule aho hakalandi'ki'ziwa na wule ku' mwenda ninga ki'ntu'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.56",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.56"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "57",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:57"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "57",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali'vi u'lu' wule wigele hangi' ku' mwenda ninga ki'ntu' cheni'cho, sanga wu'landalile. Haho yi'li'koov'iwa ku'ki'tima moto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.57",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.57"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "58",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:58"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "58",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sumbwa mwenda ninga ki'ntu' cheni'cho i'cho chakanzagwa na ku'siniwa wule, yi'li'koov'iwa ki'kanzwe ka wu'v'i'li', nacho ki'lav'e chasosoka.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.58",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.58"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
